==Battleground==
*6 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Metal Hippoes are 100% meaning they posses no threat, and even Heavenly Hippoe at 200% doesn't have enough stats to counter pure Labyrinth spam.

